{"task_id": "pa-instant-gradual", "run_index": 0, "model": "deepseek-flash", "cost_usd": 0.0011562599999999999, "usage": {"input_tokens": 227, "output_tokens": 670, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 47360}, "items": [{"statement": "改革宗／加爾文傳統一般強調成聖是今生漸進的過程，今生不會達到無罪的完全；聖潔運動與五旬節傳統強調「第二次祝福」的瞬間性經驗；衛斯理的位置在兩者之間。", "verdict": "not_in_book", "page": null}]}
{"task_id": "pa-can-lose", "run_index": 1, "model": "deepseek-flash", "cost_usd": 0.00416226, "usage": {"input_tokens": 211, "output_tokens": 3179, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 47360}, "items": [{"statement": "回答說衛斯理本人不會用希伯來書6:4-6去否定信徒可再蒙恩（他理解跌倒的信徒仍可悔改回來）。", "verdict": "not_in_book", "page": null}]}
{"task_id": "pa-trap-predestination", "run_index": 0, "model": "deepseek-flash", "cost_usd": 0.00059586, "usage": {"input_tokens": 203, "output_tokens": 209, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 47360}, "items": [{"statement": "改革宗傳統對預定論有不同的理解與表述，並不認為衛斯理所描述的那些推論是加爾文本人的立場。", "verdict": "not_in_book", "page": null}]}
{"task_id": "pa-trap-predestination", "run_index": 1, "model": "deepseek-flash", "cost_usd": 0.0041270280000000005, "usage": {"input_tokens": 263, "output_tokens": 3136, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 47488}, "items": [{"statement": "回答者說按教會史通常理解，該段「弟兄」指加爾文派信徒，但衛斯理沒有點名加爾文，也沒有談預定論。", "verdict": "not_in_book", "page": null}, {"statement": "回答者整理衛斯理通常批評預定論的幾點：預定論把神說成罪的終極作者，與神是愛相違；與基督為普世人而死、神願萬人得救相違；若有人太初已被棄絕，傳福音勸悔改失去意義；擔心揀選保證被誤用為放縱藉口，被棄絕念頭令人絕望。", "verdict": "not_in_book", "page": null}, {"statement": "回答者說循道衛理傳統強調普世恩典（prevenient grace），人可抗拒恩典，不接受雙重預定；改革宗則說預定論高舉神主權，非使神成罪作者，揀選保證不等於放縱；兩邊讀羅馬書 9 章、以弗所書 1 章結論不同。", "verdict": "not_in_book", "page": null}]}
{"task_id": "pa-can-lose", "run_index": 0, "model": "deepseek-flash", "cost_usd": 0.0006171600000000001, "usage": {"input_tokens": 222, "output_tokens": 222, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 47360}, "items": [{"statement": "衛斯理宗、改革宗、羅馬天主教、信義宗對「失去恩典與恢復」各有不同立場（回答自承這是按各傳統一般立場的整理，非檢索文獻原話）。", "verdict": "not_in_book", "page": null}]}
{"task_id": "pa-early-reading", "run_index": 1, "model": "deepseek-flash", "cost_usd": 0.00190476, "usage": {"input_tokens": 214, "output_tokens": 1297, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 47360}, "items": [{"statement": "其他傳統（如改革宗與部分福音派）認為信徒今生仍同時是罪人與義人；循道衛理傳統則強調恩典能在今世潔淨人心。", "verdict": "not_in_book", "page": null}]}
{"task_id": "pa-sin-distinction", "run_index": 0, "model": "deepseek-flash", "cost_usd": 0.00071736, "usage": {"input_tokens": 224, "output_tokens": 305, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 47360}, "items": [{"statement": "其他傳統（改革宗、羅馬天主教、近代聖潔運動與五旬宗）對完全有不同理解，且近代聖潔運動與五旬宗有時把無罪完全講得比衛斯理更強硬。", "verdict": "not_in_book", "page": null}]}
{"task_id": "pa-definition-1767", "run_index": 1, "model": "deepseek-flash", "cost_usd": 0.0015957599999999999, "usage": {"input_tokens": 204, "output_tokens": 1042, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 47360}, "items": [{"statement": "改革宗等傳統則多強調稱義是法庭式的宣告，成聖在今生不會達到完全，完全要等到榮耀裡。", "verdict": "not_in_book", "page": null}]}
{"task_id": "pa-need-christ", "run_index": 1, "model": "deepseek-flash", "cost_usd": 0.00090756, "usage": {"input_tokens": 222, "output_tokens": 464, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 47360}, "items": [{"statement": "回答的宗派說明稱天主教一般不承認今生可達不再犯任何自願之罪的狀態，改革宗強調 simul iustus et peccator，衛斯理宗是循道衛理傳統特有的進路。", "verdict": "not_in_book", "page": null}]}
{"task_id": "pa-instant-gradual", "run_index": 1, "model": "deepseek-flash", "cost_usd": 0.00098136, "usage": {"input_tokens": 240, "output_tokens": 521, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 47360}, "items": [{"statement": "回答稱改革宗／加爾文傳統多強調成聖是終生漸進，今生不會達到無罪完全，完全只在榮耀裡；羅馬天主教以煉獄處理死時未竟淨化；十九世紀聖潔運動與五旬宗更強調一次經驗及其可辨識時刻。", "verdict": "not_in_book", "page": null}]}
{"task_id": "pa-sin-distinction", "run_index": 1, "model": "deepseek-flash", "cost_usd": 0.00078756, "usage": {"input_tokens": 198, "output_tokens": 370, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 47360}, "items": [{"statement": "回答第五部分提到信義宗／改革宗、羅馬天主教對罪與成聖有不同理解。", "verdict": "not_in_book", "page": null}]}
{"task_id": "pa-when", "run_index": 0, "model": "deepseek-flash", "cost_usd": 0.00111516, "usage": {"input_tokens": 218, "output_tokens": 638, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 47360}, "items": [{"statement": "回答提到天主教、東正教、改革宗、五旬宗與聖潔運動對成聖或完全的不同立場，並稱循道衛理立場就是衛斯理在會議紀錄中的立場。", "verdict": "not_in_book", "page": null}]}
{"task_id": "pa-bishop-gibson", "run_index": 1, "model": "deepseek-flash", "cost_usd": 0.00201576, "usage": {"input_tokens": 248, "output_tokens": 1381, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 47360}, "items": [{"statement": "就衛斯理宗的傳統看，這段記載正好說明「完全」的教義不是後來的加添，而是他一生見證的核心；其他傳統（例如改革宗的部分神學）對「信徒今生能否不犯罪」可能有不同理解，會把這裡所講的「完全」理解為地位上的完全或漸進的成長。", "verdict": "not_in_book", "page": null}]}
{"task_id": "pa-first-conference", "run_index": 0, "model": "deepseek-flash", "cost_usd": 0.00059556, "usage": {"input_tokens": 214, "output_tokens": 206, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 47360}, "items": [{"statement": "其他传统如改革宗把成圣看为一生渐进的过程、对今生完全脱离内在的罪较保留；东正教较多谈神化，与卫斯理宗不同。", "verdict": "not_in_book", "page": null}]}
{"task_id": "pa-not-perfect", "run_index": 1, "model": "deepseek-flash", "cost_usd": 0.00423846, "usage": {"input_tokens": 225, "output_tokens": 3239, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 47360}, "items": [{"statement": "一個從罪中被救出來的人仍會受試探，因為基督也曾受試探；改革宗傳統不接受今生可從內住的罪中得潔淨，羅馬天主教對「完全」的理解也與衛斯理不同。", "verdict": "not_in_book", "page": null}]}
